      {
        "id": "aria-basic_attack-perfect_pitch",
        "name": "Perfect Pitch (Basic Attack)",
        "description": "Hold [BASIC] to activate:\n\nAria enters a charging state and can reach three levels of charge. Releasing [BASIC] or reaching the maximum charge time causes Aria to unleash a powerful downward attack forward based on the current charge level, dealing massive Ether DMG.\n\nIf there is /bFandom Power//b nearby while Aria is charging, she will absorb the /bFandom Power//b, with each absorbed /bFandom Power//b instantly increasing charge level by 1 and granting 1 stack of a buff that increases the next /bBasic Attack: Perfect Pitch//b's Ether Anomaly Buildup by 10%. This buff can stack up to 2 times and is removed after the attack ends.\n\nAfter the 4th hit of /bBasic Attack: Sweet Melody//b, /bSpecial Attack: Full-Sugar Electronica - No Ice//b, an /bEX Special Attack//b, the 3rd hit of /bBasic Attack: Perfect Pitch//b, a /bQuick Assist//b, a /bChain Attack//b, or an /bUltimate//b, if there are at least 2 /bFandom Power//b nearby, hold [BASIC] to consume 2 /bFandom Power//b and quickly activate the 3rd hit of /bBasic Attack: Perfect Pitch//b. After the 3rd hit of /bBasic Attack: Perfect Pitch//b, a /bChain Attack//b, or an /bUltimate//b, if there are at least 2 /bFandom Power//b nearby, the 3rd hit of /bBasic Attack: Perfect Pitch//b can also be quickly activated by pressing [BASIC] within a short window, consuming 2 /bFandom Power//b. Anti-Interrupt Level is increased while charging, and received DMG is reduced by 40%. Character is invulnerable while using this attack.",
