      {
        "id": "aria-ultimate-100_percent_energy",
        "name": "100% Energy (Ultimate)",
        "description": "When Decibel Rating is at Maximum, press [ULTIMATE] to activate:\n\nReleases all her power, entering /bMoment of Delusion//b, and fires multiple powerful shots at the target, dealing massive Ether DMG.\n\nUpon entering /bMoment of Delusion//b, Aria gains 3 stacks of /bAll-Out Cheering//b and activates /bEther Veil: Delusion Reprise//b. While /bEther Veil: Delusion Reprise//b is active, all squad members gain an additional 50 ATK for 30s. Re-activating /bEther Veil: Delusion Reprise//b will first cancel any existing instance of /bEther Veil: Delusion Reprise//b.\n\nWhile Aria is charging, if she has /bAll-Out Cheering//b, stacks of /bAll-Out Cheering//b are consumed first to charge. Each stack of /bAll-Out Cheering//b consumed increases the charge level by 2. Upon entering /bMoment of Delusion//b, if Aria already has /bAll-Out Cheering//b, all remaining stacks of /bAll-Out Cheering//b are first converted into /bFandom Power//b and generated on the field. Each stack of /bAll-Out Cheering//b is converted into 2 /bFandom Power//b.\n\n/bMoment of Delusion//b lasts for up to 15s. During /bMoment of Delusion//b, Aria's /bBasic Attack: Perfect Pitch//b 3rd hit is upgraded to an enhanced version. When exiting /bMoment of Delusion//b, if Aria has /bAll-Out Cheering//b, all remaining stacks of /bAll-Out Cheering//b are converted into /bFandom Power//b and generated on the field. Each stack of /bAll-Out Cheering//b is converted into 2 /bFandom Power//b. Character is invulnerable while using this skill.",
